                    // marker. Critical for the "attribute name slot"
                    // position (`<div id='x' MARKER>`) — bare `onabort=…`
                    // never fires on a static div, but `onfocus=alert(1)
                    // autofocus tabindex=0` and `ontoggle=alert(1) popover`
